      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆騎士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The objective of the Flavius Battle is to score 2 points before your enemy by destroying their crystal.",
      "translation" : "弗拉維烏斯戰場的目標是摧毀敵方水晶，搶先獲得2分。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆騎士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The crystals for both armies are protected by special barricades that cannot be destroyed by direct attacks.",
      "translation" : "雙方的水晶都受到特殊路障保護，無法直接攻擊摧毀。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆騎士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But they can be removed by destroying the Guardians that protect the enemy army base.",
      "translation" : "不過，擊敗守護敵方基地的守衛，就能移除路障。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆騎士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The crystals are immune to every type of skill; your physical attacks are the only choice for destroying your enemy's crystal.",
      "translation" : "水晶免疫所有技能，只能用普通攻擊摧毀敵方水晶。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆騎士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you are ready, start by clicking the ^0000FFbattle button from the interface^000000.",
      "translation" : "準備好後，請點選^0000FF介面上的戰鬥按鈕^000000開始。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please remember: when you join a battle, you will be receiving a token which indicates the set duration for which you cannot participate in the same type of battle.",
      "translation" : "請記住，參加戰鬥後你會獲得一個標記，顯示再次參加同類戰鬥前必須等待的時間。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You may check the duration by pressing the Alt+U keys.",
      "translation" : "按Alt+U可以檢視等待時間。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Guillaume Knight]",
      "translation" : "[吉約姆騎士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Guillaume Knight",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please bear in mind once you cancel, ^0000FFyou may not reapply for 1 minute^000000!",
